From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dodaskot <pessdres@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 18:33:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 032/131] a22x: audio - MT6833 AFE via the MT8192 AFE driver,
 MT6359 codec card

- pmdomain: mediatek: MT6833 audio domain
- clk: mediatek: MT6833 audsys gates (vendor table), AFE as child
- ASoC: mediatek: mt8192 AFE accepts mediatek,mt6833-audio (register
  compatible), audiosys reset optional; new reduced mt6833-mt6359 card
- dts: audsys/AFE, MT6359 codec, MTKAIF and I2S0/I2S3 pin states

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
